=== Analysis Plan

    - Primary analysis restricted to high-affinity TSPO binders; genotype composition reported with every model
    - Spearman or Pearson correlations between TSPO-PET binding and PEM recovery time
    - Mixed-effects models with random intercepts for subjects to assess PET signal trajectory
    - Pre-specified primary ROI (anterior cingulate cortex); secondary ROIs corrected by false discovery rate
    - Voxel-wise analyses reported as exploratory only, with explicit correction and no primary inference
    - Adjustment for age, sex, disease duration, baseline severity, and objectively measured physical activity
    - Paired peripheral-central analysis: plasma and CSF markers correlated with TSPO binding in the same participants
    - Persistence analysis: in participants whose hs-CRP and IL-6 normalise, test whether TSPO binding remains elevated
    - PEM-trajectory and genotype subgroup analyses are exploratory and reported with confidence intervals, not as powered tests
